<%# Shown to a login that is not linked to a player at a Tameside club: by every `member`
    route (middleware/secured.js) and by the stats pages. The Auth0 login is shared with
    the Stockport league's site, so this is also what their players see here. Linking is
    done by the results secretary, never by the visitor (controllers/authLinkController.js). %>
<div class="container my-4">
  <h1 class="h4">Your login isn't linked to a player yet</h1>
  <p>
    Result entry, stats and club pages are for Tameside league players, so we need to know
    which player you are first. Ask the results secretary through the
    <a href="/contact-us">contact form</a> to link your login, and say which club you play for.
  </p>
  <p class="text-muted small">
    Logged in with a Stockport league account? Their site is separate: this login works
    there as before.
  </p>
</div>

<%- include('footer.ejs') %>
</body>
</html>
